{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05533","headline":"潘司马别业 · 周瑀","name":"潘司马别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门对青山近，汀牵绿草长。\n寒深包晚橘，风紧落垂杨。\n湖畔闻渔唱，天边数鴈行。\n萧然有高士，清思满书堂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周瑀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05533.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05533","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}